** Stage 4B: STATEV-only injection test
** Objective: Test if SDVINI initialization alone can create a valid cycle-20 continuation
** Method: Initialize only STATEV from cycle-19, do NOT initialize stress
** Expected: Will differ from explicit cycle-20 due to stress state mismatch
** This tests SDVINI functionality and stress effect on continuation

